        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s516",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · 60-Day Smile Guarantee Every custom dent",
            "text": "<strong>60-Day Smile Guarantee<br> </strong>Every custom dental appliance is backed by our 60-Day Smile Guarantee because your satisfaction is our top priority.<br> <br> Each appliance is crafted to your unique dental structures with care and precision. We have a have a 95% accuracy rate but just like at the dentist, some cases may need a short adjustment period or a small modification to achieve the perfect fit.<br> If something doesn’t feel quite right, simply contact us within 60 days of receiving your appliance. We’ll adjust or remake it for free—and if you’re still not satisfied after that, we’ll give you a full refund.<br> <br> Our goal is simple: to make sure you love your new smile and feel confident every time you wear it.<br> <br> <strong>Damages and issues</strong><br> Please inspect your order upon reception and contact us immediately if the item is defective, damaged, or if you receive the wrong item so that we can evaluate the issue and make it right.<br> <br> Teeth Whitening Gel can only be returned if it is unopened and sealed in its original packaging. <br> <br> <strong>Shipping Policy</strong><br> Upon the purchase of our appliance, we will promptly send you an impression kit along with a prepaid return label. This kit will allow you to create an accurate mold of your teeth from the comfort of your own home. Once we receive your completed impressions, we will begin the process of crafting your final product.<br> <br> While we strive to ensure a smooth shipping process, we are not responsible for any mistakes made by the delivery affiliates such as USPS or UPS. Once the product is handed over to the shipping carrier, any issues or delays in delivery are beyond our control. The shipping address provided by the customer during the ordering process will be the address used for shipping.<br> <br> To keep you informed about the status of your shipment, we will provide you with a tracking number. This will allow you to monitor the progress of your package until it reaches its destination.<br> <br> Please note that while we make every effort to provide estimated delivery dates, we cannot guarantee exact delivery dates due to potential unforeseen circumstances or issues that may arise during transit. Therefore, we are unable to accept order cancellations based on later-than-expected delivery dates.<br> <br> We recommend that you review and verify the accuracy of your shipping address before completing your purchase to avoid any delivery complications. In the event that the provided address is incorrect or incomplete, resulting in the package being undeliverable or lost, we cannot be held responsible.<br> <br> If you have any questions or concerns regarding our shipping policy, please feel free to contact our customer support team, and we will be happy to assist you.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
